X:1
T:Jesus Christ Is Risen Today
T:EASTER HYMN
C:Music: from Lyra Davidica, 1708 · Words: 14th Century Bohemian Latin carol. Stanzas 1-3 translated in John Arnold's Compleat Psalmist, 1749. Stanza 4 Charles Wesley, 1740, alt
S:Open Hymnal Project ABC (openhymnal.org; marked public domain), melody line with every stanza as printed there; their source: almost exactly like "Church praise: with tunes", 1885 Hymn 91 page 74 also look at "Congregational church hymnal", 1887 Hymn 151 page 120 and "Hymnal of the Pro. Melody cross-checked against the hymnary.org score (hymnary.org/tune/easter_hymn_lyra_davidica): 100% of pitches and 100% of note lengths agree.
M:4/4
L:1/4
Q:1/4=120
